&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Engineer II – Vietnam (Remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an IT Engineer II to join our growing global IT team in Vietnam. In this role, you will help ensure reliable IT operations, secure device and access management, and a seamless technology experience for employees working remotely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support employees across the full IT lifecycle, from onboarding and device provisioning to troubleshooting, access management, security compliance, and offboarding. You’ll work closely with internal teams, vendors, and senior IT engineers to maintain a secure, scalable, and efficient IT environment as Quince continues to grow globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is hands-on, highly resourceful, and comfortable solving a wide range of technical problems independently while knowing when to escalate more complex issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-User Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key point of contact for IT support requests and troubleshoot hardware, software, account, and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timely remote support to employees and ensure issues are resolved with minimal disruption to productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee onboarding and offboarding by provisioning and deprovisioning devices, accounts, applications, and access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide employees on IT best practices, security policies, and effective use of workplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation for common issues, troubleshooting procedures, and resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Asset &amp;amp; Device Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inventory of laptops, accessories, peripherals, and other IT assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provision, configure, and manage employee devices throughout their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enroll and manage devices using MDM platforms such as JAMF, Kandji, or Microsoft Intune.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor device compliance, encryption, software versions, and security configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate device procurement, replacement, repair, shipping, and recovery with employees and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage user accounts, groups, applications, and access permissions across systems such as &lt;strong&gt;Google Workspace, Okta, or JumpCloud&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support joiner, mover, and leaver processes while ensuring appropriate access throughout the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with periodic access reviews and maintain adherence to least-privilege principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot authentication, SSO, MFA, and account-access issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Infrastructure &amp;amp; Remote Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide remote support for Wi-Fi, VPN, conferencing, collaboration tools, and other workplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot basic networking issues involving IP, DNS, VPNs, firewalls, and connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support network and security infrastructure under the guidance of senior IT engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with conference room and AV technology when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with vendors and internal teams to resolve infrastructure and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support endpoint security, patch management, encryption, and device compliance initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help monitor and remediate security and compliance issues across managed devices and accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with periodic access reviews, IT audits, and enforcement of security policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate potential security incidents or policy violations to the appropriate security or IT teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; IT Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive IT processes and work with senior engineers to automate them using available tools and scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use scripting or automation to improve provisioning, account management, reporting, and troubleshooting workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving IT processes, tools, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain internal IT knowledge bases, SOPs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of hands-on experience in IT support, IT operations, systems administration, or a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting remote employees and troubleshooting hardware, software, account, and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with MDM platforms such as JAMF, Kandji, or Microsoft Intune.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity and user administration in Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, Okta, JumpCloud, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of networking fundamentals including IP, DNS, VPNs, Wi-Fi, and firewalls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with device provisioning, asset management, access management, and employee onboarding/offboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of endpoint security, patching, encryption, and basic IT security practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, particularly when supporting non-technical users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a fast-paced, globally distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting employees across multiple countries or time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Apple and Windows device environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Okta, JAMF, Kandji, Intune, Google Workspace, or similar enterprise IT platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic scripting or automation experience using Python, Bash, PowerShell, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with IT service management platforms and ticketing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with endpoint security, EDR, DLP, or other enterprise security tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with IT vendors and managing hardware logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology, e-commerce, or startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist – Supply Chain Operations Research&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Data Scientist – Supply Chain Operations Research to join our Supply Chain Planning Science team in Bangalore. In this role, you will develop and productionize advanced Operations Research and optimization solutions that influence critical supply chain decisions across warehouse routing, transportation, inventory planning, and network optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own meaningful modelling workstreams end-to-end, from problem formulation and experimentation through production deployment, monitoring, and iteration. You will work closely with Data Science, Planning Tools Engineering, and supply chain stakeholders across Bangalore and Palo Alto to translate complex operational challenges into scalable, measurable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who combines strong Operations Research fundamentals with engineering fluency and a bias toward production impact. You will apply rigorous scientific methodology to real-world supply chain problems while helping the team adopt AI-native approaches to modelling, experimentation, and optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations Research &amp;amp; Modelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own meaningful modelling workstreams across dynamic warehouse routing, shipping cost optimization, multimodal transportation, inventory placement, network flow, and PO allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take modelling problems end-to-end, from problem framing and data preparation through model development, deployment, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex operational challenges into well-defined optimization problems with clear objectives, constraints, and measurable success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Operations Research methodologies including Linear Programming (LP), Mixed-Integer Programming (MIP), Constraint Programming (CP), heuristics, vehicle routing, and network flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select, configure, and tune appropriate optimization solvers and methodologies based on problem characteristics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run rigorous experiments using historical and operational data to evaluate model quality and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze model performance, identify limitations, and iterate on approaches based on scientific and operational evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Science&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI-native workflows including LLM-assisted model formulation, agentic decomposition of complex optimization problems, and AI-augmented experiment design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate AI-generated approaches alongside classical optimization techniques using measurable outcomes and scientific rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate AI-generated hypotheses, recommendations, and modelling approaches before incorporating them into production decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team standards and best practices for applying AI effectively and responsibly within Operations Research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deploy optimization models into production rather than limiting work to analytical prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the monitoring, performance evaluation, and iteration lifecycle of models after deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain feature pipelines, optimization workflows, and model-serving components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Planning Tools Engineering on solver integration, feature stores, evaluation frameworks, and model-serving infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure models remain performant, reliable, and maintainable as supply chain networks and operational conditions evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply engineering best practices around reproducibility, testing, monitoring, experimentation, and production model quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Geography Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Palo Alto Planning Science team on shared supply chain optimization problems and modelling methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions developed across Bangalore and Palo Alto integrate effectively and avoid duplicated efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate modelling approaches, assumptions, results, limitations, and trade-offs through clear written documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively across distributed teams and time zones with a strong emphasis on asynchronous communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with logistics, warehouse, and supply chain planning stakeholders to understand operational challenges and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate operational realities into well-defined optimization problems and actionable modelling requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert model outputs into recommendations and decision-support capabilities that operations teams can effectively use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate the strengths, limitations, assumptions, and appropriate applications of scientific models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence technical and business roadmaps through data-driven insights and rigorous modelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of experience in Operations Research, Data Science, Applied Mathematics, Industrial Engineering, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and deploying production models that have delivered measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in optimization methodologies including LP, MIP, CP, heuristics, vehicle routing, and network flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience solving supply chain Operations Research problems such as warehouse routing, transportation optimization, inventory placement, network optimization, or procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take modelling problems from formulation and experimentation through production deployment and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering fluency across areas such as feature pipelines, solver integration, experimentation infrastructure, and model serving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with real-world operational data, including noisy, incomplete, or continuously changing datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experimentation, backtesting, and model evaluation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with optimization solvers and production-grade Data Science workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience applying AI/LLM tools to scientific workflows such as model formulation, problem decomposition, or experiment design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex technical concepts to technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in ambiguous environments and collaborate effectively across teams and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in Operations Research, Industrial Engineering, Computer Science, Statistics, Applied Mathematics, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce, retail, logistics, supply chain, transportation, or warehouse optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with optimization solvers such as Gurobi, CPLEX, OR-Tools, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience solving large-scale vehicle routing, network optimization, or other combinatorial optimization problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production-grade optimization or decision-support platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed Data Science or Operations Research teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using AI/GenAI tools to accelerate scientific experimentation and modelling workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud-based Data Science, optimization, and model deployment platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Development Engineer III – Mobile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Software Development Engineer III – Mobile to join our growing engineering team and help build high-performance mobile experiences for Quince customers. In this role, you will design, develop, and optimize React Native applications that deliver fast, reliable, and seamless experiences at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take ownership of complex mobile engineering problems, with a strong focus on performance, scalability, and user experience. You’ll work closely with Product, Design, and Backend teams to build scalable solutions while contributing to the evolution of Quince’s mobile architecture and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who is deeply passionate about mobile performance, enjoys solving complex React Native challenges, and is willing to go beyond standard implementations to deliver an exceptional customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Application Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-performance mobile applications using React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, reusable, and maintainable components following modern mobile engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of complex technical problems across the React Native application stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and adopt appropriate libraries, frameworks, and architectural patterns as the mobile platform evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal libraries and platform capabilities where existing solutions do not adequately address engineering requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive mobile performance improvements across rendering, startup time, memory usage, responsiveness, and application stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate unnecessary re-renders and inefficient render cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize large lists and complex UI interactions to deliver smooth experiences across a wide range of devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze application performance and proactively identify bottlenecks before they impact customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and promote performance engineering best practices across the mobile team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;React Native &amp;amp; Native Platform Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work deeply with React Native internals and modern React Native architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize solutions using technologies such as FlashList, React Native Reanimated, React Native Gesture Handler, and Expo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate complex framework and platform-level issues across iOS and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with TurboModules and native platform capabilities when React Native abstractions are insufficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and debug native iOS and Android code when required to solve performance or platform-specific problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain comprehensive test cases to ensure application quality and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex production and development issues across the mobile stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish practices that improve application stability, performance, and release quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and provide thoughtful feedback on architecture, implementation, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Backend, and other engineering teams to define and implement scalable mobile solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product and customer requirements into robust technical designs and implementation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across teams to identify technical dependencies, trade-offs, and opportunities for improving the overall customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical decisions and complex mobile engineering concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level engineers and help raise the technical bar across the mobile team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote clean coding practices, performance optimization, testing, and engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical discussions, architecture decisions, and long-term mobile engineering strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with developments in React Native, mobile platforms, and modern application performance techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of professional experience in software, frontend, or mobile engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of hands-on experience building production applications with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in JavaScript and TypeScript with a deep understanding of React Native fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of mobile application architecture, rendering, state management, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience optimizing React Native applications, including render cycles, unnecessary re-renders, memory usage, and application responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting complex React Native issues and identifying root causes across the JavaScript and native layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern React Native libraries such as FlashList, React Native Reanimated, React Native Gesture Handler, and Expo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with debugging and profiling tools such as Flipper, React DevTools, and Chrome DevTools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with iOS and Android platform fundamentals and the ability to investigate platform-specific issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TurboModules and writing native iOS/Android code when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a strong bias toward performance, quality, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with the ability to work effectively across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling consumer-facing mobile applications with a large customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of React Native performance profiling and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with the New React Native Architecture, including JSI, Fabric, and TurboModules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing native modules or integrating third-party native SDKs across iOS and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile CI/CD, automated releases, and tools such as Expo Application Services (EAS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile observability, crash reporting, performance monitoring, and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce, retail, or other high-scale consumer applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers and driving mobile engineering standards across a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Software Engineer III, Frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Software Engineer III, Frontend &lt;/span&gt;to design, build, and maintain high-quality frontend applications that deliver exceptional experiences for Quince customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll take ownership of frontend features and technical problems, work closely with cross-functional teams to translate requirements into scalable solutions, and contribute to the quality, performance, and maintainability of our frontend systems. You’ll also play an active role in code reviews, technical decision-making, and mentoring junior engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has strong frontend fundamentals, hands-on experience with modern web technologies, and the ability to independently solve complex technical problems while raising the engineering bar across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Frontend Development:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-quality frontend applications using modern web technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own frontend features and modules from requirements through implementation, testing, and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient, maintainable, and well-documented code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable components and frontend patterns that improve development efficiency and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful technical decisions around architecture, implementation, and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Reliability&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve frontend performance bottlenecks and technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply performance optimization techniques to improve application responsiveness, scalability, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and troubleshoot complex technical issues across development and production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving frontend reliability, maintainability, and overall application quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Engineering Practices&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain comprehensive test cases to ensure high-quality and reliable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate actively in code reviews and provide constructive technical feedback to peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and follow frontend engineering best practices around code quality, testing, debugging, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve development workflows, tooling, and engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Design, Backend, and other engineering teams to define requirements and implement scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product and business requirements into well-designed technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical decisions, dependencies, risks, and trade-offs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently while contributing effectively within a collaborative engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide junior engineers through technical discussions, code reviews, and day-to-day problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design discussions and help establish frontend development standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging frontend technologies, frameworks, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and recommend technologies and approaches that can improve Quince applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
