&lt;li data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot; data-section-id=&quot;16ezbc0&quot;&gt;Review product requirements, technical designs, and implementation plans to embed security early in the development lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1381&quot; data-end=&quot;1473&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1slht8d&quot;&gt;Design and build security tooling, automation frameworks, and scalable security services&lt;/li&gt;
